{"id":"aa27c371fc415029","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-kraft.md","title":"Kraft Inequality","display":"thm-kraft — Kraft Inequality","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-kraft","aliases":["43-thm-kraft"],"display":"thm-kraft — Kraft Inequality","depends_on":["[[43-df-prefixfree]]","[[43-df-string]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"§6.6, Kraft inequality","source_printed_pages":"99–100","source_pdf_pages":"119–120","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-kraft"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-kraft</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kraft — Kraft Inequality"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e7071caa967351d5\" href=\"?note=e7071caa967351d5\" title=\"43-df-prefixfree\">43-df-prefixfree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§6.6, Kraft inequality"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"99–100"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"119–120"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(S\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrefixFree}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrefixFree}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e7071caa967351d5\" href=\"?note=e7071caa967351d5\" title=\"43-df-prefixfree\">43-df-prefixfree</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrefixFree}(S)\\to\\sum_{\\sigma\\in S}2^{-|\\sigma|}\\le1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PrefixFree}(S)\\to\\sum_{\\sigma\\in S}2^{-|\\sigma|}\\le1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>前缀互不相容的二进制圆柱互不相交，各圆柱测度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{-|\\sigma|}\">\\(2^{-|\\sigma|}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，§6.6, Kraft inequality；印刷页 99–100，PDF 页 119–120。本次逐项核对陈述；下文给出笔记内论证，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-prefixfree","status":"resolved","id":"e7071caa967351d5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixfree]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-string","status":"resolved","id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-string]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixfree","status":"resolved","id":"e7071caa967351d5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$；$\\mathrm{PrefixFree}$ 见 [[43-df-prefixfree]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrefixFree}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrefixFree}(S)\\to\\sum_{\\sigma\\in S}2^{-|\\sigma|}\\le1.","display":true},{"tex":"2^{-|\\sigma|}","display":false}],"bytes":1075,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-129","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-kraft]] — Kraft Inequality"},{"id":"47ea0977fb2b6ad2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["e7071caa967351d5","1cb4649e6af56ba4"]}